From: Nouveau GF117 contributors
Subject: [PATCH] nouveau: reject unverified GF117 GPIO VID in clock preflight

VID GPIO readback and the VBIOS voltage map describe a command; they do not
independently establish the rail voltage. Preserve the existing monitoring
ABI while preventing the experimental preflight from treating it as proof.

--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/nouveau/nvkm/subdev/volt/base.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/nouveau/nvkm/subdev/volt/base.c
@@ -173,6 +173,10 @@
 		return -ENODEV;
 	if (volt->readback_is_estimate)
 		return -EOPNOTSUPP;
+	/* GF117 GPIO VID reports a command, not independent rail voltage. */
+	if (volt->subdev.device->chipset == 0xd7 &&
+	    volt->func->vid_get == nvkm_voltgpio_get)
+		return -EOPNOTSUPP;
 	*current_uv = nvkm_volt_get(volt);
 	if (*current_uv <= 0)
 		return *current_uv ? *current_uv : -ERANGE;
